+<!-- Read when: Changing or verifying outbound payment submission behavior. -->
+# Outbound Client
+
+## Payment submission
+
+- `submitPayment` sends a POST request to `https://vendor.example/v1/payments`. Source: `src/client.ts`.
+- Rejected outbound requests are attempted at most three times, with 100 ms then 200 ms waits; 100 ms is the chosen initial-delay default. Source: `src/client.ts`; coverage: `test/client.test.ts`.
